  ## Description
  
  ```
  The MLC’s Public Work Search allows anyone to view the musical work (aka song) ownership information that is in The MLC’s database. This short video walks you through how to search for and review the metadata connected to any song in The MLC’s database — including ownership shares and matched sound recordings.
  
  If you need additional help, send us an email, chat, or give us a call. The MLC Support Team is available Monday-Friday, 8 a.m.-6 p.m. CT.
